      "notes": "Baltimore County (county seat Towson; a separate jurisdiction from Baltimore City) publishes tax parcels as sub-layer 1 'Tax parcel' of the Property/Property MapServer on bcgis.baltimorecountymd.gov, and bcgisdata.baltimorecountymd.gov serves the identical service as a fallback. The layer carries the tax account number (TAXPIN), owner names (OWNER_NA1, OWNER_NA2 and the combined FULL_OWNER_NAME), the owner mailing address (ADDRESS_1, ADDRESS_2, OWNER_CITY, OWNERSTATE, OWNER_ZIP), the premise address (PREMISE_ADDRESS plus ST_NUM, STREETNAME, CITY and ZIP_CODE), land use, year built, total value and a link to the state SDAT record. CORS: the server reflects the request's Origin in Access-Control-Allow-Origin, and it also sends a misspelled Allow-Control-Allow-Origin: * header that browsers ignore. Re-verified 2026-09-26: the layer holds 374,909 parcels and an owner-name query returned live rows. Maryland's statewide MD_PropertyData layer carries owner mailing addresses but no owner names, so this county layer is the better source."
